loyment\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-0\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-0\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"content\":\"Build the static Fumadocs website and deploy it to the repository's GitHub Pages environment.\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-1\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-1\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#website-deployment\",\"content\":\"Website deployment\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-2\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-2\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#local-validation\",\"content\":\"Local validation\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-3\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-3\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#deploy-from-your-local-checkout\",\"content\":\"Deploy from your local checkout\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-4\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-4\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#verify-a-deployment\",\"content\":\"Verify a deployment\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-5\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-5\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#custom-domain\",\"content\":\"Custom domain\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-6\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-6\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#website-deployment\",\"content\":\"The documentation and renderer-only Playground live in `apps/website`. The app\\nuses Fumadocs for navigation, MDX rendering, table of contents, and static\\nFlexSearch. Next.js exports the complete site to `apps/website/out`; there is no\\nNode.js server in production.\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-7\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-7\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#local-validation\",\"content\":\"To run the website CI checks locally:\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-8\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-8\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#local-validation\",\"content\":\"`website:smoke` serves the export under the base path, with GitHub Pages'\\n`404.html` behavior, and checks the home page, a docs page, the 404 page, and\\nan interaction inside the sandboxed Playground. It blocks external requests,\\nso it needs no network. CI runs these three steps on every pull request.\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-9\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-9\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#local-validation\",\"content\":\"`RENDERIFY_SITE_BASE_PATH` is a build-time value. For the repository project\\nsite at `https://webllm.github.io/renderify/`, it must be `renderify` so static\\nassets, search, documentation links, and the Playground runtime all resolve\\nunder `/renderify`.\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-10\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-10\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#local-validation\",\"content\":\"For local root-path preview, omit the variable:\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-11\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-11\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#deploy-from-your-local-checkout\",\"content\":\"From the repository root, with dependencies installed and Git write access to\\n`origin`, run:\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-12\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-12\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#deploy-from-your-local-checkout\",\"content\":\"The command type-checks the website, builds the current working tree for\\n`/renderify/`, and publishes `apps/website/out` to the `gh-pages` branch on\\n`origin`. Local edits are included in the build. Only the static export is\\ncommitted to the publishing branch.\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-13\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-13\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#deploy-from-your-local-checkout\",\"content\":\"The first run creates `gh-pages`. In **Settings → Pages → Build and deployment**,\\nchoose **Deploy from a branch**, select **gh-pages*&#x2A; and &#x2A;*/(root)**, then save.\\nIf the `github-pages` environment restricts deployment branches, allow\\n`gh-pages` under **Settings → Environments → github-pages**.\\nSubsequent releases only need `pnpm website:deploy`.\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-14\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-14\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#deploy-from-your-local-checkout\",\"content\":\"The command reports `Published` when Git has updated the branch. To confirm\\nthe site is live, check that **Actions → pages build and deployment** succeeded\\nfor the latest `gh-pages` commit.\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-15\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-15\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#verify-a-deployment\",\"content\":\"Check these routes after the Pages job completes:\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-16\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-16\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#verify-a-deployment\",\"content\":\"`/renderify/` — landing page;\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-17\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-17\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#verify-a-deployment\",\"content\":\"`/renderify/docs/` — documentation tree and static search;\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-18\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-18\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#verify-a-deployment\",\"content\":\"`/renderify/playground/` — isolated editor and renderer;\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-19\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-19\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#verify-a-deployment\",\"content\":\"`/renderify/api/search` — static FlexSearch data;\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-20\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-20\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#verify-a-deployment\",\"content\":\"`/renderify/sitemap.xml` and `/renderify/robots.txt` — crawler metadata;\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-21\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-21\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#verify-a-deployment\",\"content\":\"`/renderify/opengraph-image.jpg` — social card referenced by `og:image`.\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-22\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-22\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#verify-a-deployment\",\"content\":\"For the Playground, run both bundled examples and verify more than visible HTML:\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-23\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-23\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-deployment#verify-a-deployment\",\"content\":\"Material UI elements have computed component styles.\"}],[\"/docs/website-deployment-24\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-deployment-24\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-deployment\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\