derer-only website Playground\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-2\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-2\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#jsx-and-tsx-mode\",\"content\":\"JSX and TSX mode\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-3\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-3\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#runtimeplan-json-mode\",\"content\":\"RuntimePlan JSON mode\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-4\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-4\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#isolation-and-network-behavior\",\"content\":\"Isolation and network behavior\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-5\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-5\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#share-and-reset\",\"content\":\"Share and reset\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-6\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-6\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#run-locally\",\"content\":\"Run locally\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-7\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-7\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"The website Playground is a static renderer host. It accepts code\\nthat you paste or edit and sends it directly to a Renderify runtime running in\\nyour browser. It has no prompt endpoint, provider configuration, API key input,\\nor LLM request.\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-8\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-8\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"This is intentionally different from the development CLI Playground:\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-9\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-9\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"Surface\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-10\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-10\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"Input\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-11\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-11\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"LLM request\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-12\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-12\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"Host process\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-13\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-13\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"Website Playground\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-14\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-14\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"JSX/TSX or RuntimePlan JSON\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-15\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-15\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"Never\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-16\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-16\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"Static files in the browser\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-17\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-17\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"CLI Playground\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-18\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-18\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"Prompt, plan, or source\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-19\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-19\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"Optional, depending on action\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-20\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-20\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#renderer-only-website-playground\",\"content\":\"Local Node.js server\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-21\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-21\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#jsx-and-tsx-mode\",\"content\":\"Paste a module with a default component export:\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-22\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-22\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#jsx-and-tsx-mode\",\"content\":\"The editor also supports React-compatible source and browser ESM packages such\\nas `@mui/material`. Renderify detects a React dependency graph, transpiles the\\nmodule, pins bare imports, and mounts it with the matching browser renderer.\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-23\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-23\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#jsx-and-tsx-mode\",\"content\":\"Source modules use Renderify's **trusted** execution lane. Only run code you\\nhave reviewed. The outer iframe is an extra host boundary; it does not turn\\narbitrary JavaScript into a declarative or untrusted plan.\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-24\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-24\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#runtimeplan-json-mode\",\"content\":\"Use this mode for the declarative path. State text uses canonical\\n`{{state.path}}` templates and events dispatch named transitions:\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-25\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-25\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#runtimeplan-json-mode\",\"content\":\"Invalid semantic fields, malformed templates, unsupported nodes, and rejected\\ncapabilities fail the render instead of being silently accepted.\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-26\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-26\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#isolation-and-network-behavior\",\"content\":\"The preview is a `@renderify/frame` sandbox: an\\niframe with `sandbox=\\\"allow-scripts\\\"` and without `allow-same-origin`. The\\neditor communicates through a transferred `MessagePort`; rendered code does not\\nreceive a reference to the parent page. The iframe applies a restrictive\\nContent Security Policy that limits module traffic to the JSPM and esm.sh\\nhosts, and synchronous loops in your code stop with an error after 1.5 seconds\\ninstead of freezing the page.\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-27\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-27\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#isolation-and-network-behavior\",\"content\":\"The first render of a dependency-heavy example can be noticeably slower because\\nthe browser must download the compiler and a cold browser module graph. Re-runs\\nreuse the iframe's transpilation and module caches. RuntimePlan-only examples do\\nnot need the React or Material UI graph and start much faster.\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-28\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-28\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#isolation-and-network-behavior\",\"content\":\"Current website limits are:\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-29\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-29\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#isolation-and-network-behavior\",\"content\":\"editor content up to 120,000 UTF-8 bytes;\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-30\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-30\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#isolation-and-network-behavior\",\"content\":\"runtime execution budget up to 30 seconds;\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-31\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-31\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#isolation-and-network-behavior\",\"content\":\"host timeout of 45 seconds, after which the sandbox is reset automatically;\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-32\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-32\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#isolation-and-network-behavior\",\"content\":\"bare package imports resolved from browser ESM CDNs, so the first such render\\nrequires network access;\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-33\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-33\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#isolation-and-network-behavior\",\"content\":\"no relative multi-file project graph or Node.js built-in modules.\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-34\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-34\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#share-and-reset\",\"content\":\"**Share** stores the current mode and UTF-8 source in the URL hash. The payload\\nstays in the URL and is not uploaded to a Renderify service. Long source creates\\na long URL, so use a repository or gist for larger examples.\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-35\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-35\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#share-and-reset\",\"content\":\"**Reset code** restores the default sample. **Reset sandbox** destroys the\\ncurrent iframe and terminates its runtime state, which is also the recovery path\\nfor a stuck document.\"}],[\"/docs/website-playground-36\",{\"id\":\"/docs/website-playground-36\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/website-playground\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/website-playground#run-locally\",\"content\":\"Open `http://localhost:3000/playground`. The website build is also fully static:\"}],[\"/docs/adr/0001-offline-declarative-mcp-app-boundary\",{\"id\":\"/docs/adr/0001-offline-declarative-mcp-app-boundary\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/adr/0001-offline-declarative-mcp-app-boundary\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"ADR-0001 Offline declarative MCP App boundary\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"Documentation\",\"Project\",\"Decision records\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/adr/0001-offline-declarative-mcp-app-boundary\"}],[\"/docs/adr/0001-offline-declarative-mcp-app-boundary-0\",{\"id\":\"/docs/adr/0001-offline-declarative-mcp-app-boundary-0\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/adr/0001-offline-declarative-mcp-app-boundary\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/adr/0001-offline-declarative-mcp-app-boundary\",\"content\":\"Keep the first MCP App adapter offline and declarative while using the official protocol SDK.\"}],[\"/docs/adr/0001-offline-declarative-mcp-app-boundary-1\",{\"id\":\"/docs/adr/0001-offline-declarative-mcp-app-boundary-1\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/adr/0001-offline-declarative-mcp-app-boundary\",\"typ