re-34\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/architecture\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/architecture#stage-2-code-generation\",\"content\":\"**Text fallback** — the raw text is wrapped as a text node\"}],[\"/docs/architecture-35\",{\"id\":\"/docs/architecture-35\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/architecture\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/architecture#stage-2-code-generation\",\"content\":\"For streaming scenarios, an incremental code generation session (`createIncrementalSession`) processes LLM deltas in real-time, using FNV-1a 64-bit hashing for efficient change detection.\"}],[\"/docs/architecture-36\",{\"id\":\"/docs/architecture-36\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/architecture\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/architecture#stage-3-security-policy-check\",\"content\":\"The `DefaultSecurityChecker` validates every RuntimePlan before execution. Checks include:\"}],[\"/docs/architecture-37\",{\"id\":\"/docs/architecture-37\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/architecture\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/architecture#stage-3-security-policy-check\",\"content\":\"**Blocked HTML tags** (script, iframe, object, embed, etc.)\"}],[\"/docs/architecture-38\",{\"id\":\"/docs/architecture-38\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/architecture\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/architecture#stage-3-security-policy-check\",\"content\":\"**Module specifier allowlists** (only permitted CDN hosts and prefixes)\"}],[\"/docs/architecture-39\",{\"id\":\"/docs/architecture-39\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/architecture\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/architecture#stage-3-security-policy-check\",\"content\":\"**Tree depth and node count limits**\"}],[\"/docs/architecture-40\",{\"id\":\"/docs/architecture-40\",\"page_id\":\"/docs/architecture\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/architecture#stage-3-security-policy-check\",\"content\":\"**Execution budget validation** (maxImports, maxExecutionMs, maxComponentInvocations)\"}],[\"/docs/architecture-41\",{\"id\":\"